{title: 007 - The Lord in Zion Reigneth}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #007 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 7}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[A7]The [D]Lord in [A7]Zion [D]reigneth, Let all the [F#7]world re[Bm]joice,
[A7]And [D]come be[G]fore His [D]throne of grace [G7]With [A]tuneful [E7]heart and [A]voice;
[A]The [A7]Lord in Zion [D]reigneth, And [Em]there [B]His [Em]praise [E7]shall [A]ri[E]ng[A],
[A7]To [D]Him shall [G]princes [D]bend [B7]the [Em]knee And [D]kings their [A7]glory [D]bring.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[A7]The [D]Lord in [A7]Zion reigneth, [D]and who [F#7]so great [Bm]as He?
[A7]The [D]depths of [G]earth [D]are in [G7]His hands; [A]He [E7]rules the [A]mighty sea.
[A]O [A7]crown [D]His [Em]Name [B]with [Em]honor, [E7]and [A]let [E]His [A]standard wave,
[A7]Till [D]distant [G]isles beyond [D]the [B7]deep [Em]shall own [D]His [A7]power [D]to save.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[A7]The [D]Lord in [A7]Zion reigneth, [D]these [F#7]hours to [Bm]Him belong;
[A7]O [D]enter now [G]His [D]temple gates, [G7]and [A]fill His [E7]courts [A]with song;
[A][A7]Beneath [D]His [Em]royal [B]banner [Em][E7]let [A]every [E]creature [A]fall,
[A7]Exalt [D]the [G]King of [D]heaven [B7]and earth, [Em]and [D]crown Him [A7]Lord [D]of all.
{end_of_verse}
